    apply: "Ask a family member how you can serve them better this week and act on it. If you are married, pray with your spouse daily. If you have children, set aside focused one-to-one time. Seek help if there is conflict or abuse. Memorise Ephesians 5:25.",
    activity: "Read Ephesians 5:21-6:4 and underline the instructions to each person. Discuss how each might serve. Role-play a family conversation that models listening and apology. Pray for homes.",
