    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners how faith should shape work.",
    mcq1: ["What does Colossians 4:1 say masters should do?", ["Treat their bondservants justly and fairly", "Threaten them", "Ignore them", "Cheat them"], 0, "Justly and fairly."],
