    sa: ["How can servant leadership be practised at work?", ["lord", "diligent", "honest", "fair", "serve", "witness"], "A good answer says believers work as for the Lord with diligence and honesty, leaders treat those under them justly and serve their growth, and excellence and integrity witness to Christ."],
